notes = "The canonical plain, poisoned and poison-damage spike world_media programs draw their actual admitted floor cells. This hardware declares those three exact spatial content IDs; only one current observed owner whose public anchor_item_uuid names this same item can delegate its loose-floorboards housing fallback. No content, position or private fixture guess substitutes for that unique identity link. Delivered2948/9f links close the old backend boundary, and old null-link recordings retain their real values. The ordinary stand-in remains when the actual owner or required admission is absent or ambiguous. All artwork remains unreviewed; source assignment is not native output or art acceptance."
